<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #dc2626;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            padding: 30px;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-top: none;
        }
        .warning-box {
            background-color: #fef2f2;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Broker Account Deactivated</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Hello {{ broker.fullName }},</p>
        
        <div class="warning-box">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">⚠️ Account Deactivation Notice</h3>
            <p>Your broker account has been deactivated by the system administrator.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="info-box">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Deactivation Details</h3>
            <p><strong>Deactivated On:</strong> {{ deactivatedAt|date('F j, Y g:i A') }}</p>
            <p><strong>Deactivated By:</strong> {{ deactivatedBy.fullName }}</p>
            {% if reason %}
            <p><strong>Reason:</strong> {{ reason }}</p>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
        
        <p><strong>Impact on Your Manifests:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>All active manifests assigned to you have been marked as inactive</li>
            <li>Consignees will be notified to request broker transfers</li>
            <li>You will no longer have access to the broker portal</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>If you believe this deactivation was made in error, please contact the system administrator immediately.</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>The OPTIMUS Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated message from OPTIMUS Shipping Portal.</p>
        <p>© {{ 'now'|date('Y') }} OPTIMUS. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
